<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Trainer Directory | BirdBox Coaching</title>
<meta name="description" content="Find a BirdBox approved coach near you &mdash; a directory of coaches who have completed BirdBox Coaching certification.">
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin: 0; background: #1C1719; }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    color: #F2EFEF;
  }
  a { color: inherit; }
  :root {
    --tcc: #4FA8DE;
    --ink: #F2EFEF;
    --muted: #8A8385;
    --line: #342F31;
    --paper: #1C1719;
  }

  .bb-topbar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 28px;
    padding: 16px 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: var(--paper);
  }
  .bb-topbar a { color: #ADA6A8; text-decoration: none; }
  .bb-topbar a:hover { color: #ffffff; }
  .bb-topbar a.is-active { color: #ffffff; }

  .bb-back {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 18px 24px 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .bb-back a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--muted); }
  .bb-back a:hover { color: var(--tcc); }

  .bb-hero {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 72px 24px 8px;
  }
  .bb-hero__eyebrow {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--tcc);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .bb-hero__title {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .bb-hero__desc {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #C7C1C3;
  }
  .bb-hero__cta {
    margin-top: 28px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding-bottom: 56px;
  }

  .bb-section {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 48px 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .bb-section--flush { border-top: none; padding-top: 24px; }
  .bb-section__label {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .bb-section__title {
    font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 28px);
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .bb-section__desc {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #C7C1C3;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  /* ---- Community Box directory frame ---- */
  .bb-directory-frame {
    margin-top: 28px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #FFFFFF;
  }
  .bb-directory-frame__inner {
    padding: 16px;
    min-height: 420px;
  }

  .bb-list {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    padding: 0 0 0 20px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #C7C1C3;
  }
  .bb-list li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .bb-list li strong { color: #E4E0E1; }

  .bb-steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2px;
    background: var(--line);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin-top: 24px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .bb-steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  .bb-step {
    background: #1C1719;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .bb-step__num {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--tcc);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .bb-step__title {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }
  .bb-step__desc {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #C7C1C3;
  }

  .bb-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--tcc);
    color: #0E1A22;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }
  .bb-btn:hover { opacity: 0.85; }
  .bb-btn--ghost {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--tcc);
    color: var(--tcc);
  }

  .bb-footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 24px 24px 60px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #756F71;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  /* ---------- PHOTO BACKGROUND BAND ---------- */

  .bb-hero-band {
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(180deg,
        rgba(28,23,25,0.82) 0%,
        rgba(28,23,25,0.74) 45%,
        rgba(28,23,25,0.97) 100%),
      url("hero-directory.jpeg");
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center 45%;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
  }
</style>
<script async>
(function() {
  xhr = new XMLHttpRequest();
  xhr.open("POST", "https://cfapi.communitybox.co/bootstrap/revision", true);
  xhr.onload = function() {
    if (xhr.readyState === 4 && xhr.status === 200) {
      var returnObj = JSON.parse(xhr.responseText);
      if (returnObj.hasOwnProperty("err")) {
        console.error(returnObj.err);
      } else {
        var r = returnObj.revision;
        var l = document.createElement("script");
        l.src = "https://dashboard.communitybox.co/embed/" + r + "/cbebloader-" + r + ".js";
        document.head.appendChild(l);
      }
    }
  };
  xhr.send("2714b035-c524-45d6-922b-e11fb12ff91f");
})();
</script>
</head>
<body>

  <nav class="bb-topbar">
    <a href="/merch">Merch Store</a>
    <a href="/blog">Blog</a>
    <a href="/trainer-directory" class="is-active">Trainer Directory</a>
    <a href="/account">My Account</a>
    <a href="/about">About</a>
  </nav>

  <div class="bb-back">
    <a href="/">&larr; Back to BirdBox Coaching</a>
  </div>

  <!-- ===== HERO BAND (photo background) ===== -->
  <div class="bb-hero-band">
    <header class="bb-hero">
      <div class="bb-hero__eyebrow">BirdBox Approved Coaches</div>
      <h1 class="bb-hero__title">Trainer Directory</h1>
      <p class="bb-hero__desc">Every coach listed here has completed BirdBox Coaching certification. Search by location to find one near you.</p>
      <div class="bb-hero__cta">
        <a class="bb-btn" href="#directory">Find a Coach &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </header>
  </div>
  <!-- ===== END HERO BAND ===== -->

  <section class="bb-section bb-section--flush" id="directory">
    <div class="bb-section__label">Approved Coaches Worldwide</div>
    <h2 class="bb-section__title">Find a Coach Near You</h2>
    <p class="bb-section__desc">Browse the directory below. Use the search and filters to narrow by location, then select a coach to see their gym, qualifications, and how to get in touch.</p>

    <div class="bb-directory-frame">
      <div class="bb-directory-frame__inner">
        <!-- Community Box directory embed (BirdBox Trainer Directory box). -->
        <div id="communitybox-target" box="3b937335-788a-49d4-a2bd-f8439eca49d5"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bb-section" id="what-it-means">
    <div class="bb-section__label">What the Listing Means</div>
    <h2 class="bb-section__title">Why BirdBox Approved Matters</h2>
    <p class="bb-section__desc">A coach in this directory has invested in formal development beyond their day-to-day practice.</p>
    <ul class="bb-list">
      <li><strong>Completed certification</strong> &mdash; each listed coach has passed a BirdBox Coaching course</li>
      <li><strong>Coaching, not just programming</strong> &mdash; trained in communication, the coach-athlete relationship, and intervention</li>
      <li><strong>Ongoing development</strong> &mdash; many go on to Level 2, mentorship, and specialist courses</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="bb-section" id="get-listed">
    <div class="bb-section__label">For Coaches</div>
    <h2 class="bb-section__title">Completed a Course? Get Listed</h2>
    <p class="bb-section__desc">If you've passed a BirdBox Coaching certification and you're not on the map yet, get in touch and we'll add you.</p>
    <div class="bb-steps">
      <div class="bb-step">
        <div class="bb-step__num">01</div>
        <div class="bb-step__title">Complete a Course</div>
        <div class="bb-step__desc">Pass any BirdBox Coaching certification, live or online.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bb-step">
        <div class="bb-step__num">02</div>
        <div class="bb-step__title">Send Your Details</div>
        <div class="bb-step__desc">Your name, gym, location, and how athletes can reach you.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bb-step">
        <div class="bb-step__num">03</div>
        <div class="bb-step__title">Appear on the Map</div>
        <div class="bb-step__desc">We'll add your pin so athletes in your area can find you.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bb-hero__cta" style="justify-content: flex-start; padding-bottom: 0;">
      <a class="bb-btn" href="mailto:Info@birdboxcoaching.com?subject=Trainer%20Directory%20Listing&body=I%20have%20completed%20a%20BirdBox%20Coaching%20certification%20and%20would%20like%20to%20be%20added%20to%20the%20trainer%20directory.%0A%0AName%3A%0AGym%3A%0ACity%20%2F%20Country%3A%0ACourse%20completed%3A%0AContact%20details%20to%20display%3A">Request a Listing &rarr;</a>
      <a class="bb-btn bb-btn--ghost" href="/tcc">See the Courses &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="bb-footer">
    &copy; BirdBox Coaching Ltd &mdash; Trading as BirdBox Coaching, The Gymnastics Course, The Endurance Course, and The Coaches Course.
